    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An isometric action puzzle game, where you sort precious gems and relics, in colorful factory levels. Control spinners, springs, and teleports, avoid hazards, fill containers, and maximize your score. Features adjustable difficulty from casual to very challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/a696562af2cfded0e321fcb90b789efb.webp?t=1749495862\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/f9ad2dfba7964e568b9f955f08ccdd15.poster.avif?t=1749495862\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/f9ad2dfba7964e568b9f955f08ccdd15.webm?t=1749495862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/f9ad2dfba7964e568b9f955f08ccdd15.mp4?t=1749495862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been tasked with sorting diamonds, crystals, statues and more. Take control of the conveyor belts in each level  to guide these precious items to the correct boxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/811bb86689c2d3b1d729c58ef69714b1.webp?t=1749495862\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/6357fa7037954abe9e6421a0fe131e78.poster.avif?t=1749495862\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/6357fa7037954abe9e6421a0fe131e78.webm?t=1749495862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/6357fa7037954abe9e6421a0fe131e78.mp4?t=1749495862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workplace safety wasn't a priority when these factories were built. Safely dispose of hot magma rocks, and deactivate laser beams before they zap the relics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/241c302e5f3e27ca6d39460da1953af3.webp?t=1749495862\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/e4a0326a07e369a2d152b0c99099ced9.poster.avif?t=1749495862\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/e4a0326a07e369a2d152b0c99099ced9.webm?t=1749495862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/e4a0326a07e369a2d152b0c99099ced9.mp4?t=1749495862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn stars for completed levels, and use them to unlock new levels. What new challenge awaits in the next area?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/ae9a9d3de4899aff56e8ba950ce51828.webp?t=1749495862\" width=600 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/ecc761d84e6e832663cbde6ee5733aa8.poster.avif?t=1749495862\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/ecc761d84e6e832663cbde6ee5733aa8.webm?t=1749495862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647450/extras/ecc761d84e6e832663cbde6ee5733aa8.mp4?t=1749495862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus levels are hidden behind secret entrances. Can you find them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two stylish worlds to explore: The Mines &amp; The Ruins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable difficulty from casual to very challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden bonus levels to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original lofi soundtrack\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
